The candidate is slightly slower in the body and indistinguishable at p99.9 at this replication depth. The apparent p99.99 improvement is not claimed because the opening baseline replicate had a much larger p99.99 than the closing baseline replicate.

Rejected pre-fix candidate runs at b0f2291 had 1.44-1.47 ms raw RTT p99.9 and 14.0-14.2 ms raw RTT p99.99. They exposed per-message FEC-arrival telemetry allocation even when FEC was disabled. Commit 4d4fdad gates the telemetry on fec_k != 0 and reserves capacity only when enabled. Only the post-fix bracket above is accepted.
